# Open-weight models in the pipeline

Contract: `docs/spec-references/SPEC-open-weight-models-in-pipeline.md`. Inherits TR-00. Do not add these ModelDefs until the user feeds TR-06. Overlay still wins: H3 Max and Wan 3.0 stay out of the live council until that fed prompt adopts them.

Every open-weight model has two forms: BASE (no LoRA, general generation) and LoRA-APPLIED (`loraEndpoints[mode]` + loraUrl + trigger). Both are selectable. Manual pick wins. Orchestrator prefers LoRA > reference > seed on consistency/style shots when a matching asset exists. One H3 LoRA applies across t2v/i2v/r2v. Verify OpenAPI before writing any endpoint string.
